    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "691132b662a9181e27de": "Many animals lost their lives so that we could gain these materials. Do not take their sacrifice lightly, $n. Handle the leather with the respect it deserves.",
        "8e4f5715b7ec670eee9d": "If you are here for further training, you have overestimated my abilities. Have a word with Telonis over there; he can help you.",
        "9d68a7219ee1ab2630d6": "In time you will be ready for what I have to teach, $n. Until then, please ask Darianna over there to help you with your training.",
        "ddb8def1648d885431ad": "Darianna shows promise, but she is so full of energy that it is hard for her to stay still and listen. With her strength and agility, I fear it won't be long before she is called to fight. We must teach her quickly.",
        "ef3053221bf0a259c377": "Train me."
      },
      "name": "Faldron",
      "subName": "Expert Leatherworker",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
